HST Office: HST commands where Microsoft Office users look for them.

- sw/sc/sd notebookbar.ui: the Review tab gets the Language group of Word, Excel and PowerPoint after
  Proofing. Its "Ngôn ngữ giao diện" drop-down (Tiếng Việt / English / Theo máy) runs the interface
  language commands of the bundled HST extension (org.hst.office.vi:UILanguage*). Labels of HST commands
  are Vietnamese in every UI language, as in the HST menu; the group name is translated.
- sw/sc/sd popupmenu/notebookbar.xml: the Help section of the ≡ menu (the Tabbed UI has no menu bar)
  gets "Kiểm tra cập nhật HST Office…" (org.hst.office.update:Check) before About, the place of the
  same entry in the classic Help menu.
- sfx2 File ▸ Info (hstbackstage.ui, hstbackstagewindow.*): "Thiết lập USB Token…" next to
  "Chữ ký số…", as Office's Info ▸ Protect Document ▸ Add a Digital Signature; it runs
  org.hst.office.vi:SetupUsbToken of the bundled extension.

License: these upstream files remain under their original license (MPL-2.0).
Test: tests/runtime/check-ribbon-hst-commands.py.
